vron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">MCP Catalog and Toolkit<span class=\"badge beta\">Beta</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Model Runner <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Gordon <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">AI and Docker Compose</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker Agent <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"sidebar-section\">\n        <h2 class=\"sidebar-heading\">APPLICATION DEVELOPMENT</h2>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker Desktop <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker Engine <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker Offload <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker Build <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker Build Cloud <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker Compose <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker Extensions <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Deprecated products and features</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Release lifecycle</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"sidebar-section\">\n        <h2 class=\"sidebar-heading\">SUPPLY CHAIN SECURITY</h2>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker Hardened Images<span class=\"badge new\">New</span><span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker Hub <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker Scout <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"sidebar-section\">\n        <h2 class=\"sidebar-heading\">PLATFORM</h2>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Support</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Billing <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Docker accounts <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Security <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Subscription <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Release notes</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"sidebar-section\">\n        <h2 class=\"sidebar-heading\">ENTERPRISE</h2>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Administration <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Deploy Docker Desktop <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\">Security <span class=\"chevron\">⌃</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item indent-1\">Add and manage domains</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item indent-1\">Single sign-on <span class=\"chevron\">⌃</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item indent-2\">Setup</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item indent-2\">Manage connections</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item indent-2 selected\">Troubleshoot</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item indent-1\">FAQs <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item indent-1\">Provision <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item indent-1\">Enforce sign-in <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item indent-1\">Roles and permissions <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item indent-1\">Hardened Docker Desktop <span class=\"chevron\">⌄</span></div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item indent-1\">Organization access tokens</div>\n      </section>\n    </aside>\n\n    <main>\n      <div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        Home <span>/</span> Manuals <span>/</span> Security <span>/</span> Single sign-on <span>/</span> Troubleshoot\n      </div>\n\n      <h1>Troubleshoot single sign-on</h1>\n\n      <div class=\"document-tools\">\n        <div><span class=\"tool-icon\">♙</span>Ask Gordon</div>\n        <div><span class=\"tool-icon\">▣</span>Copy Markdown</div>\n        <div><span class=\"tool-icon\">☑</span>View Markdown</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"intro\">\n        This page describes common single sign-on (SSO) errors and their solutions. Issues can stem<br>\n        from your identity provider (IdP) configuration or Docker settings.\n      </p>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <h2>Check for errors</h2>\n        <p>If you experience SSO issues, check both Docker and your identity provider for errors first.</p>\n\n        <h3>Check Docker error logs</h3>\n        <ol>\n          <li>Sign in to <a href=\"#\">Docker Home</a> and select your organization from the top-left account drop-down.</li>\n          <li>Select <strong>Admin Console</strong>, then <strong>SSO and SCIM</strong>.</li>\n          <li>In the SSO connections table, select the <strong>Action</strong> menu and then <strong>View error logs</strong>.</li>\n          <li>For more details on specific errors, select <strong>View error details</strong> next to an error message.</li>\n          <li>Note any errors you see on this page for further troubleshooting.</li>\n        </ol>\n\n        <h3>Check identity provider errors</h3>\n        <ol>\n          <li>Review your IdP's logs or audit trails for any failed authentication or provisioning attempts.</li>\n          <li>Confirm that your IdP's SSO settings match the values provided in Docker.</li>\n          <li>If applicable, confirm that you have configured user provisioning correctly and that it is<br>enabled in your IdP.</li>\n          <li>If applicable, verify that your IdP correctly maps Docker's required user attributes.</li>\n          <li>Try provisioning a test user from your IdP and verify if they appear in Docker.</li>\n        </ol>\n\n        <p>For further troubleshooting, check your IdP's documentation or contact their support team.</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"error-block\">\n        <h2>Groups are not formatted correctly</h2>\n        <h4>Error message</h4>\n        <p>When this issue occurs, the following error message is common:</p>\n\n        <pre>Some of the groups assigned to the user are not formatted as '&lt;organization</pre>\n\n        <h4>Causes</h4>\n        <ul class=\"cause-list\">\n          <li>\n            Incorrect group name formatting in your identity provider (IdP): Docker requires groups to<br>\n            follow the format <code>&lt;organization&gt;:&lt;team&gt;</code>. If the groups assigned to a user do not follow<br>\n            this format, they will be ignored.\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            Non-matching groups between IdP and Docker organization: If a group in your IdP does not<br>\n            have a corresponding team in Docker, it will not be recognized, and the user will be placed<br>\n            in the default organization and team.\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h4>Affected environments</h4>\n        <ul class=\"cause-list\">\n          <li>Docker single sign-on setup using IdPs such as Okta or Azure AD</li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <aside class=\"right-rail\">\n      <div class=\"right-actions\">\n        <div class=\"right-action\"><span class=\"icon\">▰</span>Edit this page</div>\n        <div class=\"right-action\"><span class=\"icon\">⚑</span>Request changes</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"toc-title\">Table of contents</h2>\n      <div class=\"toc\">\n        <div class=\"toc-item active\">Check for errors</div>\n        <div class=\"toc-item\">Groups are not formatted correctly</div>\n        <div class=\"toc-item\">User is not assigned to the organization</div>\n        <div class=\"toc-item\">IdP-initiated sign in is not enabled for connection</div>\n        <div class=\"toc-item\">Not enough seats in organization</div>\n        <div class=\"toc-item\">Domain is not verified for SSO connection</div>\n        <div class=\"toc-item\">Unable to find session</div>\n        <div class=\"toc-item\">Name ID is not an email address</div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"feedback\"><span>▣</span>Give feedback</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
